    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Bible Bloodbaths is a gory first-person physics-based game.  It involves a few sandbox levels that you can play around in. These levels include things mentioned in the Bible passage, such as fruit trees that God says not to chop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanse the promised land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Deuteronomy 20:16-18 from the Bible, you have to kill everything that breathes and you can order soldiers to help you. Your victims include animals, children, babies, and sexual worship assistants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully dynamic chopping</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your magic laser sword, you can chop people, animals, and many other objects however you like, as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8d8c3b86ed40c320dd6dfd4e8c85884e.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8d8c3b86ed40c320dd6dfd4e8c85884e.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8d8c3b86ed40c320dd6dfd4e8c85884e.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision chopping quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional quest gets you to chop people and animals in specific ways such as chopping their leg, arm, or tail. When finished you can return to the box to see how obedient you were.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sinful Temple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you can explore a temple containing things God hates like child sacrifice and sexual worship assistants. You can worship the god/goddess idols in the temple but this will cause the soldiers to target you as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/2508285ee056f5173dee97663c7e45a0.avif?t=1753933522\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy up the bodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level has you tidying up the clutter in the promised land after cleansing by pushing chopped up bodies into a pit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/abb492e88248f3b9f2c0072ab12f03e5.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/abb492e88248f3b9f2c0072ab12f03e5.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/abb492e88248f3b9f2c0072ab12f03e5.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase and chop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you have to chop people who are hiding and running for their lives and try to get a low enough cleansing time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Body Hacker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weapon allows you to hack the matrix in the game to make the targeted body part break into pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/100d788450894b3f96f2eb5f78478f63.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/100d788450894b3f96f2eb5f78478f63.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/100d788450894b3f96f2eb5f78478f63.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holy Hand Grenades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow all of the people and animals to kingdom come in slow motion. You can throw the grenades as often as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/89e6aaae18e07011fe40d955aa2b50ae.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/89e6aaae18e07011fe40d955aa2b50ae.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/89e6aaae18e07011fe40d955aa2b50ae.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other things in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also ride horses, get drunk on fermented fruit, build ladders to get over city walls, and chop just about everything including flowers and torches.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Bible Bloodbaths is a gory first-person physics-based game.  It involves a few sandbox levels that you can play around in. These levels include things mentioned in the Bible passage, such as fruit trees that God says not to chop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanse the promised land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Deuteronomy 20:16-18 from the Bible, you have to kill everything that breathes and you can order soldiers to help you. Your victims include animals, children, babies, and sexual worship assistants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully dynamic chopping</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your magic laser sword, you can chop people, animals, and many other objects however you like, as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8d8c3b86ed40c320dd6dfd4e8c85884e.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8d8c3b86ed40c320dd6dfd4e8c85884e.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8d8c3b86ed40c320dd6dfd4e8c85884e.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision chopping quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional quest gets you to chop people and animals in specific ways such as chopping their leg, arm, or tail. When finished you can return to the box to see how obedient you were.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sinful Temple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you can explore a temple containing things God hates like child sacrifice and sexual worship assistants. You can worship the god/goddess idols in the temple but this will cause the soldiers to target you as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/2508285ee056f5173dee97663c7e45a0.avif?t=1753933522\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy up the bodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level has you tidying up the clutter in the promised land after cleansing by pushing chopped up bodies into a pit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/abb492e88248f3b9f2c0072ab12f03e5.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/abb492e88248f3b9f2c0072ab12f03e5.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/abb492e88248f3b9f2c0072ab12f03e5.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase and chop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you have to chop people who are hiding and running for their lives and try to get a low enough cleansing time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Body Hacker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weapon allows you to hack the matrix in the game to make the targeted body part break into pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/100d788450894b3f96f2eb5f78478f63.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/100d788450894b3f96f2eb5f78478f63.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/100d788450894b3f96f2eb5f78478f63.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holy Hand Grenades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow all of the people and animals to kingdom come in slow motion. You can throw the grenades as often as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/89e6aaae18e07011fe40d955aa2b50ae.poster.avif?t=1753933522\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/89e6aaae18e07011fe40d955aa2b50ae.webm?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/89e6aaae18e07011fe40d955aa2b50ae.mp4?t=1753933522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other things in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also ride horses, get drunk on fermented fruit, build ladders to get over city walls, and chop just about everything including flowers and torches.</p>",
